  "title": "ML Studio 2026.11.19.1",
  "notes": "- In Pattern mode, the Piano Roll keeps looping the selected ruler range while you draw, paint, move, resize, delete, or undo and redo note edits. Ctrl+D still clears the range.\n- Channel-strip knobs, EQ controls, and grouped faders redraw only the affected Mixer areas, so their controls and value readouts update more smoothly while you drag.\n- Playlist loop edges show a resize cursor and can be dragged with either mouse button. Right-clicking inside the loop keeps it active.\n- Right-click Delete in the Playlist Clip Picker can remove all selected sources across tabs and their clip placements in one undoable action. The original sample files stay on disk.\n- The previous Browser quick fix improved docked resizing and the Downloads layout. Collections can now contain folders and subfolders.\n\nhttps://michaellanemusic.de/ml-studio/",
